                <pb facs="0717" n="1677" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1677"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 842—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-29"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 29,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Phelps states that it is conceded by the London press that the British
                    minister must leave. Prompt action advised.</p>
            </div>
